{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Overgrown, join up with a friend to explore a vibrant world overtaken by nature. A robot and a raccoon embark on a short adventure that they can only make it through together. Solve puzzles and navigate a post-human world to reveal a wordless story of disregard and abandonment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op</strong> - Two-player, local cooperative gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong> - Use each character's unique abilities to solve puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong> - Discover lush environments while you travel into an abandoned city </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Play</strong> - Consider the impact of play in a subtle cautionary tale about climate change</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712090?t=1756234606","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712090?t=1756234606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712090/3e79df8e81fe677828c89b18982313e9ee95e143/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756234606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712090/3e79df8e81fe677828c89b18982313e9ee95e143/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756234606","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Overgrown, join up with a friend to explore a vibrant world overtaken by nature. A robot and a raccoon embark on a short adventure that they can only make it through together. Solve puzzles and navigate a post-human world to reveal a wordless story of disregard and abandonment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op</strong> - Two-player, local cooperative gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong> - Use each character's unique abilities to solve puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong> - Discover lush environments while you travel into an abandoned city </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Play</strong> - Consider the impact of play in a subtle cautionary tale about climate change</p>","developers":["Three Raccoons in a Trench Coat"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712090/064fde47a88bf7276b43b13346984cb65ca433fe/header.jpg?t=1756234606","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133694,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133694/movie480.mp4?t=1752187052","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133694/movie_max.mp4?t=1752187052"},"name":"Overgrown Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133694/fdd59b7c860a4e474cdfd66c946c1beb3036f331/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752187052","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133694/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752187052","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133694/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752187052"}}],"name":"Overgrown","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4670K / AMD FX-8350 CPU or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 660 / AMD Radeon R9 2